D.. APPROVAL OF THE AGENDA  -  Action: accept (Pass) Moved by Amy Thomas Howorth

E.. PUBLIC COMMENTS (3 MINUTES PER PERSON PER ITEM) {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
