I.. ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION OF ITEMS TO BE DISCUSSED IN CLOSED SESSION

CONFERENCE WITH LABOR NEGOTIATORS
(Government Code Section 54957.6)

Agency Negotiator: 
Peter Brown, Chief Negotiator

Employee Group(s): 
Manhattan Beach Firefighters' Association

II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:33 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 8:23 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with all City Councilmembers present. \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Manager Mirzakhanian announced that the City Council went into Closed Session to discuss the items as listed on the agenda. There was no reportable action taken.\i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\fs22\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 8:24 PM, Mayor Lesser adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\fs22\par
}


